%N A401284 Triangle read by rows: T(n,k) is the number of nonisomorphic n X k binary matrices with all column sums 2 and row sums at most 2, under row and column permutations.
%H A401284 Andrew Howroyd, <a href="/A401284/b401284.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..1325</a> (rows 0..50)
%F A401284 G.f.: 1/((1 - x)*Product_{k>=2} (1 - x^k*y^k)*(1 - x^k*y^(k-1))).
%F A401284 T(n,k) = A000990(k) for n >= 2*k.
